1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
零下三十度，饺子冻在院里
−30°C: dumplings freeze in the yard

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
东北年味，从一缸酸菜开始
New Year starts with a kraut jar

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
白菜码盐，压块大石头
Salted cabbage, pinned by a stone

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
封一个月，发酵出那口酸
A month sealed — the sour is born

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
五花肉剁馅，拌进酸菜
Pork belly minced into the kraut

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
这是东北的"杀猪菜"
This is the Northeast's pig feast

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
冬天的院子，天然大冰箱
The winter yard: a giant fridge

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
冻一帘饺子，随吃随煮
Freeze a tray, boil anytime

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
除夕夜，全家一起包
New Year's Eve, the family folds

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
酸菜那口酸，是过冬底味
That sour is winter's warmth

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,200
一锅热气，冻不住的年
Steam the cold can't freeze — agree?

12
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,400
下集：成都，饺子不蘸醋
Next: Chengdu, no vinegar at all

